    "detailed_description": "The finished epic tactics RPG is finally here!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeep below Legacio is the land known as Centralia. Within lies three city-kingdoms which include Gala, where our story begins.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRuby Pyre is a thief who gets caught, but is given an opportunity by the King's nephew to become a General of Gala's Woman Army. Red Cloud, a shadow, failed to save Ruby and vows to stop the royal family.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGala, using its male and female armies, are set off to find an ancient treasure said to contain some strange power. So begins the war of the sexes in a bid to find the 'cores' in this Core War.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nElle (pronounced Ellie) Clare, Iris Green, Mike Cullen, and many others will join this story in a quest to bring Centralia back to some peace. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy a thrilling tactics RPG where each decision may end the battle itself!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCredit to Victor Sant &amp; GubiD for Engine.",
